{{!--
  Shared layout fragment for all transactional emails.
  Embed it via Handlebars partials when feature renderer supports it; until
  then each template inlines the same shell. The fragment is kept here as
  the canonical visual reference so future templates stay consistent.

  Palette (soft, modern):
    Background:    #f5f6fa
    Card:          #ffffff
    Primary text:  #1f2937
    Muted text:    #6b7280
    Accent:        #6366f1   (indigo-500)
    Accent hover:  #4f46e5   (indigo-600)
    Code chip:     #f3f4f6
    Border:        #e5e7eb

  Layout:
    600px max, 32px outer padding, 12px corner radius, soft 4–10px shadow.
    System font stack so it inherits the OS look on any client.
--}}
